{"id":"n83174-1-11","stage":1,"title":"결정 · 决定","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83174-1-11-1","ko":"이번 가족 여행은 어디로 가?","zh":"这次家庭旅行要去哪儿？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가족","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행은","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5915e71e36aac7f9da1b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83174-1-11-2","ko":"글쎄. 그냥 부모님의 결정에 따르려고.","zh":"呃，就打算听从父母的决定吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄.","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29723","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부모님의","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결정에","meaning":"决定","explanation":"결정：决定；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"결정","audio":"/audio/3725567246990eb8a507.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83174","senseId":"1","lemma":"결정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따르려고.","meaning":"遵从，遵循","explanation":"따르다：遵从，遵循；려고：非敬语地表达打算，或根据语调询问意图。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"5","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7ca52d3e5ceed208","term":"글쎄","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3","entryId":"29723","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"3725567246990eb8","term":"결정","zh":"决定","audio":"/audio/3725567246990eb8a507.mp3","entryId":"83174","definition":"明确地确定怎么做某事；或指经此确定的内容。","pronunciation":["결쩡"]},{"id":"3ad4e3c6c1e70dee","term":"따르다","zh":"遵从，遵循","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3","entryId":"64547","definition":"原封不动地执行规定的法规、程序、惯例或他人的意见。","pronunciation":["따르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a6920c678f3ec98499a1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83174","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.5534,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这次家庭旅行要去哪儿？","呃，就打算听从父母的决定吧。","今天多亏了你，我的心情轻松了不少。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这次家庭旅行要去哪儿？","呃，就打算听从父母的决定吧。","今天多亏了你，我的心情轻松了不少。"],"answer":1}]}
